**命题158.6（带共振分母的有限平均界）。** 有

$$
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
\left|
\frac1N\sum_{n=3}^{N+2}\varphi(e_n)
-\int_G\varphi(h)\,d\mu_G
\right|
\le{}&\frac{K_\varphi A_\zeta}{N}+2\eta\\
&+\sum_{\substack{k\in F\\\chi_k(g)\ne1}}
|c_k|\min\left\{1,\frac{2}{N|1-\chi_k(g)|}\right\}.
\end{aligned}
}
\tag{158.15}
$$

